00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:09.360
But aren't there many people who feel like they don't relate to these works?

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.730
To the younger generation, these are just old stories.

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:12.240
Old stories

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.400
