00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:27.140
I've lived my life in shame.

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:34.570
I have no idea what a human life is.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:22.490
I'm sorry for being late.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:25.120
Were you visiting your husband again?

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:26.750
Yes.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:28.750
We're already open.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.920
I'll change right away.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.260
He's going to get executed anyway.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:40.930
This is Mayumi.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:46.430
Her real name, as I found out later, is Tsuneko.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:52.600
She's the woman I am said to have killed.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:07.160
At that time, I was involved with an anti-government movement.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:17.000
According to the Ministry of the Interior,
there are over 100,000 unemployed people.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:20.130
The cities are flooded with people who lost their jobs.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:23.390
There are countless numbers of people in the villages who sell themselves!

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:30.680
C-Countless!

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:33.850
Uh...

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:40.780
My... My sister...

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:43.450
was also sold...

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.120
to save the family budget!

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.780
She was only 16!

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:48.950
Student!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.460
It's a revolution!

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.710
Now is the time to overthrow the government!

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:57.250
An armed uprising is drawing near!

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.800
Write your name there and join us!

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:01.840
I'll sign!

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:02.840
Me too!

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:07.720
Help us raise funds to buy weapons!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:14.060
Collecting money is so easy.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.020
Right, Captain?

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.860
You're quite the actor too.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.280
I was just clowning around.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.490
You make a perfect clown.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:24.660
Oh really?

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:32.290
But we say it's for the poor while squeezing money from those who are even poorer...

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:36.710
What would they think if they found out that you're actually filthy rich?

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.590
Young Master.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:51.930
Your father is furious that you're still involved in illegal activities.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:55.770
It's to make the world a better place.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:05:00.270
Are you still studying art?

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:04.900
Your father said that if you damage his reputation as a congressman,

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.950
he'll quit giving you allowance.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.700
If this goes on, I won't be able to protect you.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.120
I hope this isn't the last.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:21.210
Without allowance, I'd have no choice but to die.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.590
Please tell that to my father.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:38.850
Everyone is under arrest!

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:40.110
Freeze!

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:40.730
Basta—

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.190
It's the special police.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:42.820
Crap!

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:44.400
Come quick!

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:45.490
Let's escape through the window!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:48.780
Hey, have you checked the bathroom?

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.450
Push harder!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.200
Idiot! Do it now!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:56.620
Hey, freeze!

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:06.880
Let's go!

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.340
Chase them without drawing attention.

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:10.640
Let's see where they go.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.220
We stand out together.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:16.640
Let's split up.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.690
Who took our funds?

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:19.900
Hey, lemme borrow some cash.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.980
Didn't you get your allowance today?

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:23.480
Stop it!

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:26.190
Don't touch me! They'll notice us.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:29.200
So you did get it. Geez.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:31.570
He who has is he who pays.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:32.410
Later!

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:48.090
I've lived my life in shame.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:05.110
You'll go to high school in Tokyo.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:07.110
I...

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.400
Understood?

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:21.120
I wish to become an artist.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:51.820
Shit!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.420
Mayumi!

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.380
Welcome.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.340
Are you alone?

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:09.920
Come with me when you're done.

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.670
Okay?

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.930
I'm so lonely...

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:17.430
I know of a nice modern bar.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:20.520
I'm sure it has something that'll make you happy.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:22.560
What do you think?

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.020
You'll come, won't you?

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:24.810
I'm sorry.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.400
My brother came out here from the countryside.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:28.150
Come with me.

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.370
Uh...

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:44.040
Please let me hide here for a while.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.710
That guy just doesn't give up.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.500
What would you like?

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.210
Anything...

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.340
Okay then...

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:54.170
Please bring me my bottle.

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:54.840
Okay.

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:56.260
No, I...

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.510
Don't worry.

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:00.720
I'm pretending like you're my brother.

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.560
Welcome.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.480
Oh, Kosuge!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:06.650
Welcome!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:22.370
Oh, you're already done with work?

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:24.960
Where's your guest?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:28.830
He went to the bathroom.

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:06.160
Sorry for bothering.

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.870
Come back again!

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.430
You can come out now.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.770
How long are you gonna stay in there?!

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:34.070
Looks like you hid me instead.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.190
Don't worry about it.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:36.860
Why?

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:40.110
He's from the special police, isn't he?

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:42.200
He's a regular at the bar.

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.410
Always putting on airs...

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:45.580
I hate him.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:49.290
And you were frightened too.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:50.250
I see.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:56.880
You're cute.

00:10:57.840 --> 00:10:58.800
Uh...

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.600
We'll be in trouble if we're found.

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:05.760
Let's pretend to be lovers.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:07.560
Sure.

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:14.230
Hey!

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:17.780
Run away!

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:19.030
Hey!

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.240
Let me go!

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:21.570
You damn whore!

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:22.450
Quick!

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:24.530
Why won't you let me go?!

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:32.460
I've lived my life in shame.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:34.790
Nice smile, Yo.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:43.390
I still don't understand anything about human behavior.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:12:00.650
Women in particular are such mysterious creatures.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:14.670
Why?

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.670
So you came back for me.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.510
I'm happy.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:35.730
You smell nostalgic.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.070
It's probably the smell of paint.

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:39.570
I'm an art student.

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:41.400
You are?

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.490
So you're going to become an artist?

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.780
I'm not talented though.

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:54.870
I feel at ease.

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:57.710
Me too.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:04.220
I should quit visiting my husband.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:07.640
Is he the one in that photo?

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:12.350
He's serving time right now.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:14.690
You wanna hear about it?

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:16.350
Not really.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.530
I'm fed up with this world.

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:33.950
Hey, go start a revolution.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:37.250
Aren't you in that movement?

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:38.920
No way.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.760
I joined them 'cause I wanted to act cool.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:47.050
Hell, I'm not even interested.

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:49.180
It's just that I can't draw,
so I have nothing better to do.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:53.310
Isn't it artistic to be rebellious?

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:56.730
No way.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.190
You shouldn't act like that.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:01.150
You're pure.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.280
I can tell.

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:08.950
Don't you think that there's
something wrong with this world?

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:13.200
That there's something wrong with how you live?

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:21.330
Why do women only see things how they want to see them?

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:26.420
Why do they shy away from the truth?

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:30.590
What's the matter?

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.180
It's nothing.

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:38.850
Back then, I'm sure I wanted to kill that woman.

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:43.770
Do I really have a way to live?

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:47.320
I got cut off by my parents and I have no money.

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:50.660
Now, I have nowhere to go.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.370
A school cap!

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:57.870
A sketchbook!

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:58.370
A book!

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:05.170
So Yozo also wants a book?

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:11.090
The store at the Asakusa Shrine sells lion dance masks.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:16.060
Children like to put them on and play.

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:17.470
Would you like one?

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:20.270
I think Yozo would rather have a book.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.600
I see.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:32.030
I made him angry.

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:38.700
I made Father angry!

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.640
There I was at the store in Asakusa.

00:15:54.640 --> 00:16:00.640
I opened my notebook and saw "lion dance" written there.

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:02.520
Oh my.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:04.560
And I didn't write that.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.520
Yozo must be pulling my leg.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:09.110
He's such a weird boy.

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:12.650
He must have changed his mind and wanted it really badly.

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:16.370
I broke into laughter at the toy store.

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:28.210
I'm so ashamed.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.590
Of what?

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.880
My life.

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:39.970
I am too.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:42.430
I can't go back to that bar.

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:47.400
I'm tired.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:09.670
Will you die with me?

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:10.770
I borrowed this from a friend.

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:13.860
I see.

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.320
I feel a little sleepy.

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:22.990
Do you mind pushing me?

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:34.420
If I'm reborn,

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:38.170
I'd like to live more like a human.

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:39.630
Yeah.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.100
Come right after me, okay?

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:44.930
'Kay.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.670
He's still breathing!

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.590
Hey! Hurry up!

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:58.250
Get a boat!

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:01.510
It looks like the guy who collapsed on the rocks attempted a double suicide!

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:05.930
They said they found a woman's sash and sandals at the top of the cliff.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:06.970
Then...

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.350
Let's look for her.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:10.600
The woman might be still alive!

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:18.980
Cute...

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:20.110
Be a good boy.
Cute...

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:20.780
Be a good boy.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:22.610
Don't tell your father about this.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:26.660
Your father is furious.

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.790
Would you like one?

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.660
Sleeping pills?

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:35.370
How many would you like?

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:43.050
He's such a weird boy.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.840
You're pure.

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:49.350
Nice smile!

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:51.020
That was on purpose.

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:52.730
You make a perfect clown.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.350
You're cute.

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:00.730
I'm fed up.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:03.070
Hey!

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:07.450
Is that so?

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.200
I should quit visiting my husband.

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:17.830
Come right after me, okay?

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:36.690
Are you sure it was a double suicide, Inspector?

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:40.610
I heard he said that he killed the woman.

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:42.110
Who told you that?

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:44.320
Don't write an article based on rumors.

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:45.110
Inspector!

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:46.450
We've found the woman.

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:47.530
What?

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:48.820
Hey.

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:50.120
Look, he's awake.

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:53.240
So, is she still alive?

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:54.410
Well...
